id: pm-web-orfk
title: Move pm-web onto pm-cli 2026.7.26 and pm-changelog 2026.7.25
description: "Aligns pm-web with the fleet-wide dependency floor established by the 2026.7.26 typed-authoring rollout. pm-web carried no defineExtension any-shim so it was outside that rollout, but it should track the same CLI and changelog generator versions as the rest of the fleet. Supersedes the dependabot pm-changelog PR, which could not pass changelog:check on its own because the generated changelog needed regenerating against the 2026.07.26 release tag."
