resolution: "Bumped @unbrained/pm-cli to ^2026.7.26 and pm-changelog to ^2026.7.25, and regenerated CHANGELOG.md against the 2026.07.26 release tag."
expected_result: pm-web tracks the same dependency floor as the rest of the fleet with no behavior change.
actual_result: "typecheck clean; 144/144 tests pass including the mutation-event watcher and realtime listener suites; changelog:check passes."
